`build` writes INDEX.header ("lean-align-index<TAB>code <hash><TAB>genome <FNV-1a64 of the FASTA>"); `map` throws before reading the
index if the header is missing, malformed, or its code hash is not the one compiled in. Old indexes are rejected: re-run `build`.
